      "message": "fix(import): bound, meter and refuse the second boundary search\n\nReview of PR #1638, items 1-3, on the STEP importer's second parameter\nsearch for B-spline and NURBS faces (step_nearest):\n\n- The sample grid is capped: a face with more knot spans than the grid\n  covers at one sample a span (4,096) gets no grid, and a boundary point\n  that needs the search refuses the face by name.\n- Each second search is charged to the face's evaluation budget (#1536)\n  before it runs; past the cap the face trips like any runaway, and a\n  refused face runs no further search.\n- An answer outside the knot domain that no search brings inside is no\n  longer passed on: the search answers nothing and the face is refused\n  by name. An answer inside the domain is kept as before.\n\nDecision entry: docs/decisions/1602-thread-strip-mesh.md, section 4.\n\nRefs #1602\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
